Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.80,0:00:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯家惨遭灭门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,数周之内 斯巴达克斯与逃跑的角斗士震惊卡普亚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位名叫赛普修斯的年轻贵族派出雇佣军追杀他们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人肯定挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the man dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.57,0:02:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,找吃的 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supplies. Be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,值钱的东西都拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take anything of value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让他的老二晒太阳\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave his cock to the sun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.53,0:03:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我留个信儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I send a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给一个老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}To an old friend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.39,0:03:40.54,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:45.19,Title,0,0,0,0,,《逃亡》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培太傻了 竟然孤军对抗塞托里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey was a fool to engage Sertorius absent support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培什么时候考虑过能不能打\N{\fnArial\fs30}When has Pompey ever delayed action in favor of reason?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.15,0:04:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年了 屠夫小子还是没长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Advancing in years yet ever the adolescent butcher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,年轻人要经受挫折才能成熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where youth plummets, maturity may soar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果庞培挡不住叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome will lose all of Hispania{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.70,0:04:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马必然丢掉整个伊伯利亚（西班牙）\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Pompey's numbers are not shored against the renegade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么谁能领导这支军队赢得荣誉呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who would lead such a force to glorious accolade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准是新鲜出炉的民政官吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freshly minted praetor, perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我效忠于共和国 马科斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I serve the Republic, Marcus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.35,0:04:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一声令下 我们就为国杀敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will take arms against her enemies if so commanded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,民政官的漂亮袍子还没起皱纹呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The embellished robes of a praetor not yet to wrinkle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.79,0:04:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就大谈什么战争和荣誉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet he speaks of war and laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.98,0:04:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的只是国家要务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I speak only of pressing matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.35,0:04:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要战争和荣誉不用特意出国吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need not tread foreign soil to find them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.99,0:04:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 瓦里留斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}do we, Varinius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 斯巴达克斯那帮杂种还没落网呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not when Spartacus and his mongrels continue to evade capture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.54,0:04:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不关心那人的死活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is no longer bound to my concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在卡普亚城外的道路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}More of young Seppius' men were slaughtered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.96,0:04:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小赛普修斯死了不少手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the road outside Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说在其中一个死人的身上发现了你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sends word to me that one of the fallen bore your name, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就刻在那家伙胸前\N{\fnArial\fs30}carved into his chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么悲惨的羁绊\N{\fnArial\fs30}An unfortunate tether.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.67,0:05:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要快刀斩乱麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly to be severed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,科萨特斯还在等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cossutius awaits my attentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我向令媛道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies to your daughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能留下来一睹芳容了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I could not linger to gaze upon her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你答应下次来访 我们便能稍感安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disappointment to be tempered with promise of future visit. Hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 可以开席了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, let us break meal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,执政官一个手势\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Consuls will present a motion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.09,0:05:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可以派你去卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}dispatching you to Capua at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿比努斯 这种鸡毛蒜皮的小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a simple tumultus, Albinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得由民政官亲自出马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undeserving the attentions of a praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.05,0:05:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把色雷斯人带到罗马的 盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought the Thracian to Roman soil, Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你资助了那个笑嘻嘻的巴蒂塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You granted patronage to that grinning shit Batiatus a breath{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后他全家惨遭屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}before his house fell to massacre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿差点就没逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}A massacre my daughter barely fucking escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯派人去支援赛普修斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varinius lends his support to Seppius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果最后斯巴达克斯落到他手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he is the one to bring Spartacus to justice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你必定要遭到羞辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}then that victory will be used to embarrass you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好自为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attend to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你在元老院没有出头之日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or see yourself rise no further within the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.31,0:06:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,剑不要放低\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't lower your sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有八个罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight more Romans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他们上西天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent to the afterlife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.91,0:06:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,派拉蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peirastes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.27,0:06:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,给准备好的人换上真家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Replace wood with steel, for those who are ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,维特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vitus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.47,0:06:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮拉斯 莱山德斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pyrrhus! Lysandros!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己挑选趁手的家伙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divide these among you according to skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好大展身手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ready the rest for demonstration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯 我们需要吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus. We need food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.83,0:07:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是杀人的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not more weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们身上只有武器和钱币\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steel and coin are all they carried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯他们好过多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus' men fare better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhaskos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.29,0:07:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.24,0:07:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去找马塞勒斯了 那个拉皮条的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seeks Marcellus, the cunt peddler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.43,0:07:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的人收获不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your men have done well for themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,平均分给大家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See everyone to equal portion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的东西绰绰有余\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have more than enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是拿命换来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gained by blood and risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们除了躺着又出过什么力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they do but lay about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出来平分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divide what you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不说第二遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not ask again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking Gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯是个自私的蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhaskos is a selfish fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼里只有那点蝇头小利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unable to see beyond his own desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.12,0:08:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚不会有人挨饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will go hungry tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那明天呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tomorrow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天会死更多罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will bring death to yet more Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乐意看到他们全都倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see all of them struck down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不拿你的命作代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet not at the cost of your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.86,0:08:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这人注定命大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have proven troublesome to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人是你的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no one that stands your equal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可对于那些弱者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet for those less skilled, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.43,0:09:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,迁徙到东边的山里生活是再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}moving towards the mountains in the east would be sorely welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.60,0:09:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里猎物很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game is plentiful there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且罗马人很少\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Roman numbers sparse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,想法很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be wise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.15,0:09:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们还等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why do we stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What holds us here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离卡普亚这么近 这么危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}so near Capua and the threat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你竟敢使唤我的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you wish to command my men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是提醒他们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simply to remind them of what is just.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你当时在场 一样会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have done the same, had you been present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会跟他们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall have words with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,由你亲口说 他们更容易接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would be better received from your lips.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.91,0:10:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又去城里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in town again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.81,0:10:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risk discovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人发现 除了马塞勒斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not seen, except by Marcellus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远不会泄露出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will never speak of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的命有用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did his blood bear fruit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}A name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.41,0:10:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,特莱比斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trebius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.51,0:10:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个奴隶贩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slaver?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.97,0:10:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他有关系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will point towards her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.94,0:10:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,马塞勒斯说他促成了妮维雅的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcellus revealed that he brokered deal of Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.87,0:10:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪里找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.85,0:10:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每个月都来卡普亚做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He frequents Capua upon each moon, to trade his wares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还去阿米纽斯的窑子找快活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to wet his cock at Arminius' brothel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大快人心的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}News to lift the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:11:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不罢手 一定要找回妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}It remains firmly bound, until Naevia is back in my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在此发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have those words now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.98,0:11:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有见到教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you had sight of Doctore?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,训练场是他的命根子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ludus was his life's blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是让他看到血溅训练场的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To lay eyes upon those who have spilled it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,无异于伤口上撒盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would salt mortal wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.79,0:12:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你简直像个娘们 快他妈的动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fight like a woman! Fucking kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,难看死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A poor showing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.20,0:12:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Magistrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经是优中选优了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were the best that could be procured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.16,0:12:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众们喜欢大场面 蒙卡图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd demands spectacle, Mercato.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.50,0:13:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要分散他们的注意力 避免城市陷入混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must be distracted, lest the city fall to ill temper and panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.97,0:13:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还看什么角斗比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladiators and games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯和他的杀人团伙还在逃呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}While Spartacus and his murdering horde roam free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥正在积极处理这件事 赛皮娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother has the matter well in hand, Seppia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话挺安慰人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words of comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于他今早损失的八个手下来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the eight of his men slaughtered this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.18,0:13:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,八个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.45,0:13:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有急事耽误了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressing business conspired to delay me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 赛普修斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true, Seppius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有八个人死在斯巴达克斯手里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight more of your men, fallen to Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,小事一桩\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing of little note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯很快就会举手投降了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus will soon be brought to terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.25,0:13:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后为我们亲爱的堂兄赛克斯报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our beloved cousin Sextus avenged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你难逃一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you to join him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.22,0:13:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,留我一个人无依无靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving me woefully unattended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:13:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是这么无情的哥哥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What form of brother would I be, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,连最亲爱的妹妹也不要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to abandon such cherished blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,难看死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A poor showing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.11,0:15:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身上没钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have nothing of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seek only words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am absent them as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是巴蒂塔斯家的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were Batiatus' man, were you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:16:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他名叫奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oenomaus, he was called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运不是那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is fortunate you are not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他犯有背叛主人的重罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man stands accused of turning upon his dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉拿他的赏金相当可观\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reward for his capture is a substantial sum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯就更贵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards Spartacus yet higher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he were to be revealed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.97,0:16:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样的人就可以逍遥自在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man such as you could continue not being himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.29,0:16:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过 我身上没钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I said, I have nothing of worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.38,0:16:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有赏金\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lesser sum then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.17,0:16:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是巴蒂塔斯家的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not Batiatus' man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not be outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看月亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to see the moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅努斯喜欢看月亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janus loves to gaze upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗把他举过肩膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro would hoist him upon his shoulders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.26,0:17:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会伸出双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he would stretch his hands out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要把月亮从空中摘下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}attempting to wrest it from the heavens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.60,0:17:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一天他能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps one day he shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不会踩在他父亲的肩膀上\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not upon his father's shoulders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅努斯太小了 还不太记事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Janus is yet too young for memory to take proper hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.65,0:17:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他长大后会忘了我今天的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt he would recall the sight of me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are his mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.00,0:17:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,岁月也不能改变这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Years would not lessen such a bond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.86,0:17:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会在你的注视下成长 犹如东升的旭日\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will burst as sun through clouds, at the sight of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.71,0:17:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从我们分开 我就梦想着这样的场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have dreamt of nothing else since our parting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,米拉常常说起东边的大山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mira speaks of the mountains, to the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在考虑是不是派人去那里打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have thoughts dispatching men to hunt for game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥照顾雅努斯 他离那儿不远 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother tends to Janus not far from there, does he not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,月亮伸手可及\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moon within closer reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以缩短你们的距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would shorten the distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我不希望这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I have not longed to have it so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,远远地离开你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be far from all of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.85,0:18:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们一样打上了逃犯的烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am branded fugitivus with the rest of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种朝不保夕的生活 我又怎么照顾儿子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What life could I offer my son beneath such shadow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.73,0:19:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.89,0:19:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有离开罗马才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.36,0:19:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从我们上路到现在积攒的钱币\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the coin I have relieved the Romans of since our escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够作你和儿子的盘缠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to buy you and your son passage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 远走高飞吧 - 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- far from these shores. - Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗临终时就提到你和雅努斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Varro's last words were of you and Janus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.80,0:19:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我好好照顾你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I see you cared for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用说我也要做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need not have been spoken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,给克里斯坎蒂亚带话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send word to Crescentia that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.97,0:19:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这周的午餐时间都要推迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must move our mid-day meals later in the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.65,0:19:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有回应瓦鲁斯的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}And respond to Varus' request{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就说我们出席他的庆典\N{\fnArial\fs30}for our presence at his celebration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.69,0:19:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not be attending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.27,0:20:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不喜欢那家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you do not care for the man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.64,0:20:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过他人脉很广\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet he is well connected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must make appearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都要怪你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your father would have it otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.01,0:20:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他派我去卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dispatches me to Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理斯巴达克斯的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}To deal with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再找他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have word with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.00,0:20:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他决心已定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is set upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.30,0:20:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是民政官 盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a praetor, Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,追杀奴隶的事情太下作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting errant slaves is beneath you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是非做不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet it must be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我答应你 在孩子降生前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I promise we will return to Roman well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定能回到罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}before our child enters this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然要陪我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will accompany me of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.61,0:20:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因为资助的事情结交了巴蒂塔斯家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am bound to the House of Batiatus by patronage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:21:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果呢 你犯下人命案 要我擦屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted only to bury knowledge of the blood staining your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱姬尼娅的事完全是意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Licinia was an accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.13,0:21:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是马科斯•克拉苏的堂妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was cousin of Marcus Crassus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a fucking bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.16,0:21:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有知道真相的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All who knew of the deed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.15,0:21:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}speak no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别想这件事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us put it behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去准备吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now make preparations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.86,0:21:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去卡普亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave for Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,了结与斯巴达克斯的恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an end to the curse of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.16,0:21:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然相信马塞勒斯的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe the words of Marcellus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.78,0:21:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,刀搁在脖子上逼出来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}bleated from tongue with sword to neck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯要去阿米纽斯的窑子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus moves on Arminius and his place of whores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.37,0:21:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要助他一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will be at his side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在高卢人当老大了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we follow the fucking Gaul now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓要帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore aid in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.76,0:21:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不管 我不会有想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not think less, if you stayed from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.48,0:22:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.82,0:22:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢窑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me at whores.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.07,0:22:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要冒无谓的险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avoid unnecessary risk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要乱说话调戏克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and provoking words towards the Gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,派拉蒂斯负责打猎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peirastes leads the hunt for game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.01,0:22:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会一路保护你找到儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will have you safely to your son's arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到你离开太久的家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}From where you have been too long absent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把儿子抚养成人\N{\fnArial\fs30}See your boy to a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.38,0:22:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许有一天 我能与他兄弟相称\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I may one day greet him as a brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:22:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给雅努斯讲你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell Janus of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.21,0:23:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他 你对他父亲的爱无人可比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the man who loved his father above all others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.24,0:23:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She takes to foot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.18,0:23:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还债\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long overdue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.93,0:23:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚还有很多债要还\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are many things this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.61,0:23:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用去拼命 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not your fight, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.48,0:23:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓 以鲜血和荣耀之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave my word. Blood and honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It yet speaks to the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.73,0:23:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就用罗马人的惨叫撕开沉沉的夜幕吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let us split darkness with the cries of Romans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.74,0:25:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.00,0:25:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,特莱比斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trebius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.66,0:26:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,特莱比斯在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Trebius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.16,0:26:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.50,0:26:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我滚起来 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off the fucking floor! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.96,0:26:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我滚起来 臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the fucking floor! Bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.60,0:26:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,特莱比斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trebius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.87,0:26:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.52,0:26:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.65,0:26:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.49,0:27:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.76,0:27:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多卫兵 我们必须…\N{\fnArial\fs30}More guards! We need{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.30,0:27:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特莱比斯 该死的混蛋 - 艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trebius. You fucking cunt! - Agron{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个罗马畜生把我和杜罗卖给巴蒂塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Roman shit that sold me and Duro to Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是他 我兄弟就不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother would be alive if it were not for him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.64,0:27:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道妮维雅的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows the whereabouts of Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.14,0:27:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要带他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will take him and go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.14,0:27:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坚持不了多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.47,0:27:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need but a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.39,0:27:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮你争取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you shall have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.75,0:27:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man meets his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.76,0:27:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不就行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all that matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.81,0:27:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你促成了巴蒂塔斯家那个女人的买卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brokered the sale of a woman from the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.30,0:27:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑皮肤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dark of skin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.38,0:27:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩膀后面有主人家的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mark of the domina upon the back of her shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.76,0:27:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.05,0:27:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚去吃屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.12,0:27:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am already dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.45,0:28:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有一口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is yet life in you yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.44,0:28:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来 我给你一个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak, and see it ended quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.40,0:28:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,南边\N{\fnArial\fs30}South?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.49,0:28:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有宅子和农场 离城市很远\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are villas and farms, far from the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅就在其中一家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Naevia was sold to one of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.69,0:28:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 她被转手多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. She was handed from dominus to dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.91,0:28:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯为了当市政官 把她当礼物铺路\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift from Batiatus, to secure favor on his campaign for fucking Aedile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.99,0:28:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}These places you speak of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.22,0:28:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,防御有多严密\N{\fnArial\fs30}How heavily are they guarded?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.29,0:28:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要老天爷有眼 多严密都无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would not matter if the gods stood watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.35,0:28:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,南边有多少宅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many villas are there in the south?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.45,0:28:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离相隔多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over what spread of distance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.35,0:28:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道妮维雅曾经到过那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will you know if Naevia's even located in one of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.45,0:28:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有几家宅子属于贵族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a few are owned by men of note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.59,0:28:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯舔的肯定是他们的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cocks Batiatus would have sucked to further his cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.85,0:28:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,光天化日之下行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be exposed, in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.54,0:29:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须谨慎行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must proceed with caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.54,0:29:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好意思说谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? Advising caution?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.25,0:29:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是乌鸦笑猪黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tempest shouts for the breeze to calm itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.57,0:29:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了对妮维雅有何好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}What good will your death be to Naevia, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.19,0:29:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须计划好再行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we do not pause to think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.94,0:29:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经离开我太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has been from my arms too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.34,0:29:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间坐下来思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not have time to sit and ponder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us do now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.46,0:29:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your meaning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.61,0:29:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,特莱比斯临死前提到了罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}With his last breath, Trebius frothed of Roman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.90,0:29:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神已经从那里启程\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the death that has been dispatched from her bosom, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.45,0:29:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要置我们于死地\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wash us away in rivers of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.82,0:29:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是罗马军队吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soldiers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.82,0:29:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天亮就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arriving with the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.79,0:29:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who leads them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.89,0:30:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,整座城市都陷入恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city is in a panic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.82,0:30:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米纽斯那边遭到突袭 死了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scores were slaughtered in the raid against Arminius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.03,0:30:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.41,0:30:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他们吃饭休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the men fed and rested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.06,0:30:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落前分组搜索郊外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squads to sweep the countryside by nightfall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.49,0:30:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your will, Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.16,0:30:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,解散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fall out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.20,0:30:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卸粮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring supplies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.57,0:30:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,您带足了人马吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have enough men for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.79,0:30:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来您的手下并不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not appear you have enough men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.96,0:30:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对付奴隶而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They face only slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.70,0:30:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是大军压境的汉尼拔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Hannibal at the gates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.23,0:30:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.78,0:30:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为首的是屠影英雄斯巴达克斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Led by Spartacus, the Slayer of the Shadow of the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.71,0:30:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,行政官呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Magistrate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.32,0:30:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟有身份的人讨论此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would discuss this with someone of note.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.31,0:30:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在别处耽搁了 鉴于昨晚的情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is otherwise detained, in view of last night's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.54,0:30:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他表示歉意\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sends apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.84,0:31:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过赛普修斯非常希望有人找他谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seppius however is eager for audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.97,0:31:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙是民政官瓦里留斯的耳目\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man has Praetor Varinius' ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.14,0:31:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说我也不需要听他嚼舌根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no desire for his tongue to fill mine as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.54,0:31:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要公开讲话 安抚民众的情绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would address the people, put their minds to ease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.40,0:31:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天日出时分 就安排在市集里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow as the sun rises in the marketplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.55,0:31:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,您打算说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.17,0:31:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attend to the arrangements.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.36,0:31:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么带我来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have I been brought here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.16,0:31:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯 为什么带我来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius, why have I been brought here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.76,0:31:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来他们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}To this House?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.99,0:31:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶的视野非常好 便于观察四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hilltop offers excellent vantage of the surrounding country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.97,0:31:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,底下的训练场方便驻扎军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ludus below will easily garrison my men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.17,0:31:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好好利用吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then use it as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.03,0:31:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回到父亲的宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will remove myself to my father's villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.06,0:31:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就留在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will stay at my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.91,0:32:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去把房间打点好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, set the house to order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.94,0:32:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这里是我们的家了 伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our home now, Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.03,0:32:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到斯巴达克斯完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Spartacus falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.41,0:32:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里所有的东西全他妈的丢到悬崖下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want everything in this fucking house seen over the cliff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.13,0:32:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都换成新的 不管出多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will purchase a new appointment much coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.78,0:32:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我的夫君要我留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my husband would have me here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.51,0:32:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定愿意出这个钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he can certainly pay for the comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.28,0:32:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有的血迹都弄干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see all traces of blood cleansed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.21,0:32:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是巴蒂塔斯和黄脸婆的臭味\N{\fnArial\fs30}It reeks of Batiatus and his faded bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.19,0:32:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去呀 - 是 女主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! Go! - Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.43,0:33:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.28,0:33:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子闹出来的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In matters concerning my wife, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.28,0:33:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神都想不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the gods themselves fear to speculate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.36,0:33:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you lost wit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.88,0:34:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.62,0:34:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来之前应该通知一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have sent word you were coming…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.56,0:34:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们好准备宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would have prepared a feast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.79,0:34:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.05,0:34:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了 看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see it then? You see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.07,0:34:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅 给贵客倒酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia! Bring wine for our honored guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.45,0:34:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杀了她 杀她 杀啊 - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kill it. Kill it, KILL IT! - Praetor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.96,0:34:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是巴蒂塔斯的妻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Batiatus' wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.94,0:34:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,模样相似的幽灵罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shadow of the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.37,0:34:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet she lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.20,0:34:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在大屠杀中幸存…\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be spared from such carnage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.60,0:34:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是诸神的祝福\N{\fnArial\fs30}A blessing from the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.87,0:34:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果传播出去 能起到安抚人心的效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that would calm a city, if it were known to be such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.15,0:34:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.48,0:34:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.26,0:34:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know where she's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.30,0:35:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you pause?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.91,0:35:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可以提供有力的证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could prove a powerful symbol.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.04,0:35:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们看到这个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would give the city hope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.87,0:35:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,从斯巴达克斯等人手下生还 就能重获希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see a woman survive Spartacus and his men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.99,0:35:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能鼓起勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}And courage to confront them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.14,0:35:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,您也能尽快回到罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}speeding your return to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.68,0:35:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.54,0:35:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能留她活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot let her live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.18,0:35:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她洗澡 好好照顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}See her bathed and tended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.77,0:35:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要刺激她的神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what fragments her shattered mind yet holds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.57,0:35:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Roman army?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.79,0:35:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all of us dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.31,0:35:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,少他妈胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your fucking cock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.79,0:35:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never wanted this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.08,0:35:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些角斗士要害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gladiators, you will see us all to our end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.02,0:35:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little fuck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.24,0:35:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.80,0:36:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们早知道有这一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}We knew this day would come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.43,0:36:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人担心这一天的到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some have feared its approach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.97,0:36:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人则很渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others have longed for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.55,0:36:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有人早就明白其中深意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet few have grasped deeper meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.81,0:36:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That this moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.94,0:36:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,注定要面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}was always fated to be so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.64,0:36:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发过誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.49,0:36:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你们发过誓 就在巴蒂塔斯家灭亡当天\N{\fnArial\fs30}To all of you, when the House of Batiatus fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.05,0:36:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要让罗马发抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we would see Rome tremble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.71,0:36:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在该发抖的是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the ones that shall quake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.76,0:36:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到葛雷博带手下进城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have witnessed Glaber and his men entering the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.44,0:36:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,人数众多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough in number{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.60,0:36:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来取你们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to end your lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.96,0:37:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们一起 加大我们的筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then stand with us, and balance the odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.62,0:37:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙卡图说葛雷博将在市集发表演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mercato has announced Glaber will make address{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.92,0:37:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在明天一早\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the market as day breaks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.06,0:37:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候没人注意你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be wise to use the distraction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.84,0:37:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要妄想对抗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave such thoughts behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.95,0:37:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctore…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.82,0:37:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经不是教练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is no longer my title.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.13,0:37:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.81,0:37:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个地方可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is but one place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.13,0:37:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于失去荣誉的野兽来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}For an animal without honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.23,0:37:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们失去他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is lost to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少人跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more would you have follow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.45,0:37:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我们一起 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join with us, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.36,0:37:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们往南走 趁着葛雷博发表演讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can head south, while Glaber cups his balls and makes speeches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.64,0:37:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是为了等他才留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the reason I am here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.36,0:37:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妻子永远回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my wife forever absent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.26,0:37:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你时常告诫我要谨慎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You often preach to me about caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.87,0:37:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你来听劝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn advice now towards self.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.44,0:37:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.38,0:38:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,打杂的奴隶也能跟军队拼命\N{\fnArial\fs30}House slaves, playing at being men?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.16,0:38:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not gladiators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.66,0:38:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手里没有军队 不管你有多么渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are not an army, as much you wish it to be so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.75,0:38:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说吧 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep upon it, Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.48,0:38:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到明天日出 希望你能想清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when the sun rises, I would see reason dawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.26,0:38:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.23,0:38:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿来的水 现在可是旱季\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we come by it, with the drought?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.10,0:38:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,旱季早过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The drought is long past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.65,0:38:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得旱季结束了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not recall its ending?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.55,0:38:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is of no concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.20,0:38:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我帮你擦干 然后换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, I would have you dry and seen to proper dress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.48,0:39:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.95,0:39:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wound?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.49,0:39:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you come by it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.33,0:39:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.52,0:39:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定非常恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.44,0:39:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,困在这里逃不出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trapped within these walls…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.02,0:39:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,家养的野兽疯狂嗜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your beasts running wild…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.83,0:39:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone believed you dead, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.66,0:39:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,跌下悬崖\N{\fnArial\fs30}smashed upon the cliffs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.41,0:39:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔得粉身碎骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bits of bone and flesh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.57,0:39:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都不剩\N{\fnArial\fs30}your only testament.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.69,0:40:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么一个人活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you survive, all alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.15,0:40:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,露迪雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucretia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.04,0:40:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是朋友 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are friends. Are we not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.71,0:40:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲密无间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.15,0:40:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有很多朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have so many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.40,0:40:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾美莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aemilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.93,0:40:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯西莉娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caecilia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.23,0:40:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱姬尼娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licinia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.83,0:40:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯•克拉苏的堂妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cousin to Marcus Crassus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.58,0:40:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能认识她可就太荣幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a very great honor to be seen at her side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.96,0:40:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能为我引见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you make introduction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.19,0:40:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去换衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us see you dressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.54,0:40:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilithyia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.26,0:40:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.17,0:40:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are with child!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.89,0:41:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昆图斯跟我努力了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quintus and I have been trying for such a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.74,0:41:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.98,0:41:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神的预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sign from the gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.66,0:41:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴蒂塔斯家必将人丁兴旺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life blossoms in the House of Batiatus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.48,0:41:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们留在卡普亚的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why we are yet in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.81,0:41:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,送走奥瑞莉娅的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you saw Aurelia away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.99,0:41:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望他们派葛雷博来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hoped they would send Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.15,0:41:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.03,0:41:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我祈祷如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.77,0:41:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在又祈祷什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you pray for now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.24,0:41:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对着你并不信仰的诸神\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the Gods you do not believe in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.35,0:42:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妻子希望这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would your wife have wanted this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.20,0:42:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着夫君送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see her husband consumed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.39,0:42:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不希望的事情太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are many things she would not have wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.58,0:42:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果都成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet they are so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.83,0:42:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着克雷斯往南走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow Crixus to the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.30,0:42:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让复仇的火焰葬送那些你辛苦救下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let your vengeance claim so many you have saved from bondage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.95,0:42:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再让一个人因我而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not see another life forfeit to my desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.82,0:42:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.76,0:42:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离罗马的爪牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And move far beyond grasp of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.25,0:43:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离你所背负的这个名字 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Far from the name Spartacus they have branded you with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.13,0:43:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,与其思考飘渺不定的将来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us turn thought from uncertain future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.85,0:43:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如抓住每分每秒…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And embrace fleeting moment…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.19,0:43:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.14,0:43:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,全他妈的站好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move to fucking purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.19,0:43:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备接受命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be ready when word is given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.60,0:43:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这口气就像主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bark as a dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.94,0:43:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,面对血盆大口 绵羊才知道跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheep stand idle, if not prodded by snapping jaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.03,0:43:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.00,0:43:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,小狗的嘴巴也有这种效果吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does the maw of a pup spur the same?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.11,0:43:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那咱们对咬吧 马上知道答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us compare teeth, and have answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.64,0:43:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease your quarrels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.63,0:43:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找斯巴达克斯 听他的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am for Spartacus, and the lay of his thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.80,0:43:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚他知道要谨慎行事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night they were towards heeding caution, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.41,0:43:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定跟你们去南边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and joining you in the south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.98,0:43:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了早上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the light of morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.56,0:44:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上我醒的时候他已经走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was gone from our bed when I awoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.14,0:44:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有必要这么担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no cause for rising concerns!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.39,0:44:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里的局势已经得到控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation is well in control!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.53,0:44:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米纽斯那事儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Arminius?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.84,0:44:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈的也叫控制住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that fucking control?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.11,0:44:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.96,0:44:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是野蛮人的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an act of savagery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.39,0:44:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是只懂杀戮的野兽所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}committed by animals who know nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.57,0:44:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是这群野兽制造了巴蒂塔斯家血案\N{\fnArial\fs30}These same beasts laid waste to the House of Batiatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.13,0:44:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那晚死了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many were lost that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.02,0:44:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,体面的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women of proper standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.15,0:44:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有身份地位的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men of honor and position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.69,0:44:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的堂兄赛克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My own cousin Sextus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.77,0:44:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年备受爱戴的行政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}your beloved Magistrate of years past, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.99,0:44:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没逃过一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}among the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.77,0:44:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}He speaks the truth!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.85,0:44:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都死于疯狂嗜血杀戮的屠夫之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the hands of butchers, who crave only blood and death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.19,0:44:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也将付出同样的代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they shall see it returned in kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.19,0:45:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们由斯巴达克斯带领\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Spartacus leads them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.62,0:45:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑟奥科斯也不是他的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even Theokoles fell before him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.10,0:45:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是携雨之使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the bringer of rain!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.05,0:45:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯区区凡人一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus is but a man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.41,0:45:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是所有人都死在他手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not all fall to his touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.12,0:45:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,昆图斯•兰图拉斯•巴蒂塔斯的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wife of Quintus Lentulus Batiatus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.94,0:45:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,经受了斯巴达克斯及其走狗的残忍屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}stood against the merciless assault of Spartacus and his dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.03,0:45:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by favor of the gods…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.30,0:45:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}she yet lives!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.28,0:45:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.08,0:45:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞美诸神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gods be praised!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.30,0:45:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是赐福\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a blessing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.36,0:46:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你黯然失色了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand eclipsed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.70,0:46:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is their herald, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.43,0:46:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是从往生世界归来传递信息的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}plucked from the shores of the afterlife to deliver a message!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.58,0:46:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯绝对无法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Spartacus shall never triumph{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.23,0:46:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,征服卡普亚的人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}over the people of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.22,0:46:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He comes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.03,0:46:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he comes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.94,0:46:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he comes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.20,0:46:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持镇定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.07,0:46:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神还给了我们另一个征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet the gods grace us with further signs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.06,0:46:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的末日近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Spartacus' end is near!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.21,0:47:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get rid of her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.26,0:47:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,剁了这婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gut the cunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.10,0:47:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我手下遭遇了几个巴蒂塔斯家的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}My men came upon a clutch of Batiatus' slaves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.14,0:47:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们打算前往东边山里作恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}attempting harm in the mountains to the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.74,0:47:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这个贱货活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is all that remains among the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.02,0:47:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她因伤而死之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before she succumbs to her wounds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.79,0:47:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要逼她坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will force her tongue to purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.38,0:47:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在她临死前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with her dying breath, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.69,0:47:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就会说出斯巴达克斯及其走狗的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}she will tell me where Spartacus and his men hide themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.98,0:48:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就将他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they shall be struck, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.55,0:48:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斩草除根\N{\fnArial\fs30}from this mortal world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.03,0:48:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我盖尤斯•克罗迪斯•葛雷博动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the hand Gaius Claudius Glaber!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.06,0:48:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,得意的小杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preening little shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.69,0:48:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rather favor him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.50,0:48:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.00,0:49:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,围住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surround him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.20,0:49:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.88,0:49:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.70,0:50:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.06,0:50:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,带奥瑞莉娅走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Aurelia and go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.27,0:50:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.67,0:50:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot win this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.60,0:50:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.20,0:50:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来 就永远别指望报仇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay, and see vengeance forever denied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.83,0:51:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不比莱斯克斯和该死的高卢人强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are no better than Rhaskos and the fucking Gauls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.46,0:51:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,满脑子都是报私仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}All driven only by your own desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.17,0:51:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对你都不重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do any of us hold fucking worth to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.95,0:51:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason I went alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.54,0:51:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,还顶嘴 如果你落到葛雷博手里呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hard comfort, if you had fallen to Glaber's men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.18,0:51:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈会带着你们往南走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron would have led you south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.62,0:51:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.22,0:51:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是一个愣头青\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not some angry boy who can barely piss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.94,0:51:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,动不动就到处撒气\N{\fnArial\fs30}without splashing everyone about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.94,0:51:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you have me do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.82,0:51:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过那个奴役我妻子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn from the man that condemned my wife to slavery?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.96,0:51:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶他性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him live, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.77,0:51:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他夺走了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}that took everything from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.76,0:51:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心还在跳动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heart still beats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.68,0:51:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你靠近听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place ear to chest, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.89,0:51:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就能发现它早已死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will find it absent sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.48,0:52:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you are not dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.94,0:52:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.99,0:52:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很感激你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that you have my gratitude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.53,0:52:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是去帮你的 你这个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come to lend you aid, you mad fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.98,0:52:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是去阻止你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to stop you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.35,0:52:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拦着我不去找葛雷博复仇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would place yourself between Glaber and what he deserves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.02,0:52:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你拦着我不去找妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you would place yourself between Naevia and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.78,0:52:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为杀死一个民政官\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think would be the result{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.58,0:52:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有什么样的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}of killing a fucking praetor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.20,0:52:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,元老院绝对大发雷霆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Senate would burn upon itself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.06,0:52:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,气势汹汹地来寻仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}belching forth fire and vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.46,0:52:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝不会像葛雷博那样只带一队士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would not send a few men, as they do with Glaber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.59,0:52:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会派出成千上万人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would send thousands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.86,0:52:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.71,0:52:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们根本不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we will never be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.13,0:53:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥瑞莉娅找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aurelia calls for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.30,0:53:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.23,0:53:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.33,0:53:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应…我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise… me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.66,0:53:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.41,0:53:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我 你不会碰我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise… you will stay far from my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.04,0:53:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要他死在你的面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have him die in your wake…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.75,0:53:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他的父母一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as his father and mother…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.66,0:54:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛雷博和他的走狗要血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glaber and his men will pay in blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.43,0:54:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gather swords{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.21,0:54:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.71,0:54:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们往南走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We move south.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.22,0:54:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.84,0:54:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让克雷斯带他的高卢人寻梦去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let Crixus and the other Gauls chase lost hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.06,0:54:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯巴达克斯 - 我意已决\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spartacus - The decision's been made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.67,0:54:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must stand as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.40,0:55:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,分裂必亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or fall divided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.11,0:55:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是残酷的教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lesson hard learned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.47,0:55:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所经之地 所有的奴隶都将获得解放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shackle will be struck from every slave upon our path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.88,0:55:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要壮大队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will see our numbers grow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.73,0:55:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们拥有一支军团\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they have become legion, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.38,0:55:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再去面对葛雷博\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will face Glaber, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.76,0:55:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有罗马的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the hordes of Rome again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.82,0:55:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神将会为他们的遭遇伤心哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the gods shall weep for their suffering.{\r}
